    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or chills</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Blister on the left forefoot; no other skin breaks</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Numbness of the ends of both feet, slightly better; no falls</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

